	(gr_text "Epoxyde glass fabric copper-clad laminated sheet of defined \nflammability according to EN 60249-2-5-FVO-IEC-EP-GC Cu.\nInsulating material group according to EN 60664-1.\n• Raw material: ........................... FR4\n• PCB CTI value: ........................ ≥ 175\n• PCB core thickness: ................. 2 mm \n• Conductor thickness: ................ 1 oz (base copper clad nearly 35 μm)\n• Surface finish: .......................... lead free HAL\n• Number of layer: ...................... 2\n• Solder mask: ............................. on both layer\n• Solder mask colour: .................. green\n• Silkscreen: .............................. yes\n• Silkscreen colour: ..................... white"
		(at 170.688 66.04 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "302e132b-6dfa-4fb8-8ad4-e4d9ad1faa3e")
		(effects
